    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Alphabetron</strong>, the neon-drenched, pixel-perfect word-hunting arcade game from an alternate 1984 where dictionaries wear sunglasses and vowels fight dirty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alphabetron</strong> is a 50-level wordsearch odyssey soaked in retro glory. Search, stretch, and slam your way through themed puzzles while a funky synth soundtrack cheers you on. Find words from categories like space stuff, 80s slang and cartoons, and digital dystopias \u2014 all while pretending you're better at spelling than you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features include</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Retro 8-bit art with neon arcade vibes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 50 handcrafted wordsearch levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf Smart tile selection (straight-line only, we don\u2019t do wiggly cheating here)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 Randomized grids, so you can\u2019t just memorize where \u201cLASERUNICORN\u201d was last time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Steam achievements with witty names and pixel-perfect icons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0a Bleeps and bloops approved by at least one robot band</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look, it\u2019s just a Wordsearch game. But it\u2019s the most unnecessarily awesome Wordsearch you\u2019ll ever play.</p>",
